## Installing the Chart

```bash
# Add the repository
helm repo add {{ .Chart.Maintainers[0].Name }} {{template "custom.helm.url"}}

# Install the chart
helm install {{ .Chart.Maintainers[0].Name }} app-template -f values.yaml
```

## Configuration

Read through the [values.yaml](../../library/common/values.yaml) file of the [common library](../../library/common/) chart. It has several commented out suggested values.
The [CI tests](../../library/common-test/ci) contain a number of scenarios that may prove useful as well.

## Upgrade instructions

Upgrade instructions can be found in the [documentation]({{template "custom.helm.url"}}/docs/app-template/#upgrade-instructions).

